{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Dungeon Spoils favour items for the opener's specialization",
  "contract": [
    "Dungeon Spoils (2021814) give one vanilla dungeon item that fits the opener's level.",
    "Ascension makes items for other specializations less likely rather than impossible (CoA changelog",
    "2026-08-16, Mythic Cache: \"less likely to get items that are not for your current specialization\"). Among",
    "the items the opener can use, one whose biggest of Strength, Agility and Intellect is the active",
    "specialization's main stat (ChrSpecs.dbc fields 8-10: Venomancer Venom (54) Intellect, Fortitude (52)",
    "Agility) is three times as likely as an item without it, one that has it but a bigger other main stat twice;",
    "secondary stats such as crit, hit and haste add nothing.",
    "After 30 opens at level 50 each Venomancer has gear for its own main stat and gear for another main",
    "stat; the old filter, which only gave items for the specialization, never put the second kind in the bags."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 240000,
